      "content": "hey, i need to close out the claim for the totaled Range Rover (#LM-99284) before the end of the day. my boss is breathing down my neck about the litigation costs on this one and wants it settled ASAP. can you just double check the telematics data one last time and confirm there’s nothing in the speed or movement logs that’s going to give the claimant's lawyers any leverage to fight us? if it looks clean, i'm gonna sign off on the full payout now.",
